<title>USA: Pennichuck Corp Q3 net, share lower.</title>
<headline>Pennichuck Corp Q3 net, share lower.</headline>
<dateline>NASHUA, N.H. 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.51		    $0.72</p>
<p> Net			    377			512</p>
<p> Revs			 3,107		    3,788</p>
<p> Avg shrs		     741			715</p>
<p>	  NINE MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.06		    $1.31</p>
<p> Net			    777			937</p>
<p> Revs			 8,741		    8,856</p>
<p> Avg shrs		     734			716</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: The company attributed the decrease in net income during the 1996 period to the damper than normal conditions experienced in July 1996 which adversely affected water sales of the company's subsidiary, Pennichuck Water Works Inc.</p>
</text>
